# Ignore everything by default (this covers Linux binaries, which have no extension)...
*

# ...except folders, so git can look inside them
!*/

# ...and except the files we actually want to track
!.gitignore
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.json
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.sh

# ...and game assets: images, sounds and fonts
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.wav
!*.ogg
!*.mp3
!*.ttf

# ...and the web build that GitHub Pages serves (docs/ folder)
!*.html
!*.js
!*.wasm
!*.data
